 her normal  jojo's bizarre adventure-esque body to a  young girl's body while this does reduce  her power it also lets her be cuter and  hide her true strength which is pretty  useful for her following biscuit we have  jing  and although he is a double star he  could technically apply to be a triple  star if he wanted jing is a ruin hunter  someone who is basically an  archaeologist seeking to restore and  revive ancient civilizations however  more importantly he is the worst like  just the worst what an awful person and  terrible dad  actually i think i need to watch him  getting hit real quick  okay one more  one more  all right that's enough  one more  okay okay when it comes to jing's  abilities what is probably his most  impactful factor is his innate talent  and intuition for example he claims he  can copy any punching ability after  being struck with it once quickly being  able to understand how it works and then  replicate it for example he copied  leorio's remote punch  all right last time i swear  and this intuition actually extends  beyond being able to copy it actually  being able to tell what kind of men  people specifically use after seeing  them use their skill similar to  biscuit's understanding of nen  practically jing seems to be innately  aware of the theory side of nen for  example learning remote punch he adapted  it further into ultrasound which can be  used to detect what is hiding within or  behind something i think both of these  characters exemplify the difference  between a one and two star character in  that way there's just a little bit  something extra in how they understand  nen that just continues to elevate them  jing's final ability that we've seen is  phasing bullets by putting his hands  onto something he can shoot aura beams  or bullets through them which is very  useful in tandem with ultrasound next up  we have a member of the zodiac with a  double star crime hunter in misestom i  definitely mispronounced that i am sorry  crime hunters as the name suggests hunt  criminals mizei stomp tends to be a much  less active member and prefers to work  behind the scenes as an intelligence  supplying kind of character or in  running things like the police force he  is often referred to as the conscience  of the zodiacs trying to keep people  within a very strict set of morals for  example we see him being very vocal  about his concerns with the v6 being  such a small group in the world that  controls so much of the planet now what  can he actually do well this is one of  the few cases in hunter hunter that  shows a really fun twist on a  character's design which is then tied  into their abilities themes as his  costume is based on a cow he visually  has a very black and white theme and as  such his nan revolves around referee  cards if he shows a blue card people are  admitted to enter an area yellow will  briefly restrain them and red will expel  them it's kind of fun and while this  might not be the most powerful on paper  we see that he is at least strong enough  to be a sparring partner for netero  which speaks for itself another two star  zodiac member is sacho who might have my  least favorite character design in the  entire series he is a double star  problem hunter something we don't really  know the specifics of sacho is very  calculated and that's kind of just his  entire role in the series he's someone  who looks at everything from a very  realistic view and while we don't know  much about his powers based on his  design i think it's probably safe it has  something to do with swordsmanship but  that is just a guess tara dane is a  double star headhunter which rather than  being someone who kills people like the  title might suggest he's actually more  of a talent scout he was also the leader  of the pure paladin squad who was aiming  to reform the group however he was  killed alongside bushidora by hisoka and  unable to do so our last double star is  lynnet someone who we know very little  about aside from the fact that she's a  very small old woman who was good  friends with netero she was also a  gourmet hunter similar to menchie and  with those out of the way we can get  into the big ones the triple star  hunters of the over 600 hunters in the  association only about 10 of them have  made it to this point and of those 10 we  only know three after becoming a single  star hunter by demonstrating excellence  in your field and mentoring another  person to do so themselves triple star  hunters then went on to have remarkable  achievement in other fields as well it  isn't enough to be a master of one topic  anymore you need to be able to show that  you are among the best of the best in  everything you do which is probably why  every triple star hunter that we know  either is or was a member of the zodiac  again just a reminder jing could be a  triple star if he wanted to alright so  first off we have botobay gigante a  triple star terrorist hunter which as  the title suggests hunts down terrorists  and acts to prevent their attacks  this also means that he has a pretty  good understanding of the military law  and politics between nations this  combined with his powerful sense of  loyalty and ability to stay calm in most  situations that don't involve person  make him a very integral part in the  hunter association's role in the story  the most important thing that he really  offers to society though is that he acts  towards getting the zodiac members to  cooperate with one another even if he  isn't always successful in this  unfortunately as is the case with many  of the political characters we just  don't know what he can do as far as his  men as i mentioned most of them tend to  hide their abilities to the point that  even when periston is about to see  jing's ability he seems very surprised  that he would share his technique  cheadle yorkshire is a triple star  disease hunter similar to sanvika that  said something to notice is that zombika  was the head doctor of the hunters  association and is outranked by cheatle  this doesn't exactly mean that cheadle  is more talented as a doctor or even in  their specific field but it does mean  that cheadle outranks zambika due to  having a more widespread skill set  cheadle is currently the chairman of the  association following in netero's  footsteps after he died technically  following in periston's footsteps but  you know what i mean she is incredibly  smart and has a great moral compass  making her a perfect fit for leadership  in the association something that i  really appreciate about her character is  her ability to understand the reality of  a situation and the modesty that's tied  to that despite not being a big fan of  pearson she can still recognize that he  has aspects about himself that surpass  her and respects those traits even if  she isn't always happy about them and  capping out our list of the highest  ranked known hunters is pariston hill a  triple star hunter who is the first in  the video that we don't know which field  he's in what is interesting is that with  other characters like cheadle we know  that she's both a doctor and a lawyer so  at least we know what kind of fields she  focused on but with harrison all we know  is that he was the 12th vice chairman  and that he was the 13th chairman of the  association that's kind of it pearston  is a very playful and sneaky person he  doesn't care about winning or losing so  long as he's having fun couple into this  the fact that he's a genius and you have  an absolute menace of a human being he  very much reminds me of hisoka in a way  where he's sort of a force of chaos only  interested in his own entertainment or  goals  this is also kind of funny because they  share a voice actor in hiroki takahashi  between the adaptations but i'd say that  person is more of a chaotic neutral  character he isn't really a bad guy per  se but he is just kind of a dickling he  states that he's happy when people hate  him and that he wants to hurt the things  that he cares about something that he  thinks makes him very similar to jing we  don't really know too much about how  strong pearson is as a person or what  his nan is but we do know that he was  another one of netro's sparring partners  however he claims that he is very weak  at the same time he later calls out jing  for underestimating him so he's sending  a ton of mixed messages  based on who he is as a character though  i think we could probably believe that  he's actually decently powerful not the  most powerful especially physically but  i'm sure there is much more to him than  he wants us to believe i could see him  having a very sneaky form of nen which  could tip the scales in his favor  throughout the battle and one last thing  that i wanted to bring up before ending  the video is someone who i think should  at least be included quickly being isaac  netero while there is no reference to  netero being a triple star hunter there  could obviously be an argument made that  he could have been won the entire time  as he's said to be one of the greatest  hunters in history of course he was the  12th chairman but to play devil's  advocate that doesn't exactly mean he  had to be a triple star hunter either  because of the system that's in place he  could have just never applied for the  upgrade like jing did or it could have  just been the case that he never  mentored a single star hunter directly  to get his second star and he might have  just never reached outside of his given  field remember it isn't a power system  directly it's more about hitting very  specific achievements even if someone  was the strongest hunter that doesn't  really mean they have to do those things  required to get stars and just because  he's chairman doesn't really mean  anything to become chairman all he  really needed to do was to win in votes  again nothing to do with stars for  example in the 13th election leorio was  in the running for 